{"id":"leetcode-2239","version":1,"status":"approved","title":"Find Closest Number to Zero","summary":"For an integer array of size n, identify and return the element nearest to zero.","statement":"For an integer array of size n, identify and return the element nearest to zero. In case of ties, select the highest value among the closest elements.","constraints":["Return an element with minimum absolute value.","If positive x and negative x tie, return positive x.","The input contains at least one integer."],"topics":["arrays"],"prerequisites":[],"signature":{"name":"closest_number_to_zero","parameters":[{"name":"nums","annotation":"list[int]","adapter":"raw","source_parameter":null}],"returns":"int","return_adapter":"raw","node_policy":"values","result_mode":"return","mutated_parameter":null,"immutable_parameters":[]},"starter_code":"def closest_number_to_zero(nums: list[int]) -> int:\n    # Write your solution here.\n    pass\n","reference_solution":"def closest_number_to_zero(nums):\n    return min(nums,key=lambda value:(abs(value),-value))\n","brute_force_solution":null,"known_wrong_solutions":["def closest_number_to_zero(nums):\n    return min(nums,key=lambda value:(abs(value),value))\n","def closest_number_to_zero(nums):\n    return min(nums,key=lambda value:(value,-value))\n"],"target_time_complexity":"O(n)","target_space_complexity":"O(1)","estimated_minutes":20,"rubric":{"algorithmic_insight":1,"prerequisites":1,"implementation":1,"performance_pressure":0,"edge_cases":0},"hints":["Compare numbers first by distance from zero and then by the preferred tie direction.","The key (abs(value), -value) makes a smaller distance primary and a larger value secondary.","Return min(nums, key=lambda value: (abs(value), -value)).","Tuple ordering exactly models the required two-level ranking, so its minimum is the required array element."],"editorial":"Tuple ordering exactly models the required two-level ranking, so its minimum is the required array element.","tests":[{"id